 p=ROOT/'docs/PROGRESS.md';s=p.read_text();i=s.index('\n## Milestones');s=s[:i]+f'\nAutonomous local event milestone: native control DFF/event sequencer and physical230MOS4MIM request-to-charge parent complete nominal cases. State steps{steps}mV; catalog revision8 records12 modules/8 assemblies. Bin control/full layout/accuracy/service unfinished. Exact pre-update docs: `{rel(zp)}`.\n'+s[i:];p.write_text(s)
 p=ROOT/'docs/ARCHITECTURE.md';s=p.read_text().replace('Catalog revision7 owns current','Catalog revision8 owns current');i=s.index('\n## ');s=s[:i]+'\n## Autonomous local event phases\n\nA native four-stage static control chain admits REQUEST only while READY; SAMPLE programs magnitude, ARM enables native duration/injection, RECOVER and DONE expose later phases. Outputs gated by local PHIA while stages update during PHIB. External clock sets duration;50kHz gives roughly10us strobes. RESET is synchronous. Requests must obey valid/ready; busy pulses are not buffered. Physical230MOS4MIM parent joins this to real signed injection. This does not implement bin/DAG completion or PLIF commit/adaptation/inhibition order. Control bits do not store analog membrane or weights.\n'+s[i:];p.write_text(s)
 p=ROOT/'docs/project_spec.yaml';raw=p.read_bytes();h,t=raw.split(b'\ndocument:',1);s=h.decode().replace('article_module_catalog_v7.json','article_module_catalog_v8.json').replace('gf180_native_phase_transfer_boundary.json','gf180_autonomous_event_charge_boundary.json').replace('  live_sessions: [sequenced_signed_injector_case2_bounded_120s]','  live_sessions: []').replace('status: ten_modules_seven_assemblies_native_phase_transfer_nominal_complete','status: twelve_modules_eight_assemblies_local_event_to_charge_nominal_complete').replace('next_action: autonomous_event_bin_controls_shared_references_adaptation_inhibition_readout_dense_full_assembly','next_action: bin_DAG_commit_controls_references_adaptation_inhibition_readout_dense_full_assembly');p.write_bytes(s.encode()+b'\ndocument:'+t)
